{"version":1,"content":"<p>遼寧省一間中學被揭在進行肺結核篩查時，多名學生共用一個針頭。</p><p>當地官方回應確有此事，已對78名受影響學生開展專項檢測，檢測結果均無異常，相關調查仍在進行中。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:01:17.560188+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":78,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T14:37:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T23:34:58.579030+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T14:58:15.701211+00:00","content_hash":"b6cbe3d2ba1c6ba8686d7c455db554546b2dbf38f41081ae7c0b5e4d92903f1a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}